{"updated":"2026-10-31T11:49:30.696Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Evacuated Ukrainians from Russian-occupied Oleshky arrive in Belarus. Elsewhere, binance hit by 6.3 billion dollar crypto theft. And france's Nunez warns of high risk during protests. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 0.8 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 5.1 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 45 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.0 near 196 km NW of Port-Olry, Vanuatu. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.33,0.36,0.4,0.44,0.49,0.52,0.55,0.58,0.6,0.65,0.78,0.89,1.07,1.45,1.57,1.63,1.65,1.67,1.72,1.74,1.76,1.79,1.83,1.88,1.96,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.15,2.19,2.23,2.26,2.32,2.38,2.43,2.46,2.51,2.55,2.6,2.65,2.68,2.74,2.8,2.87,2.98,3.1,3.22,3.25,3.29,3.32,3.38,3.42,3.5,3.61,3.69,3.76,3.84,3.9,3.95,3.99,4.04,4.09,4.11,4.13,4.19,4.21,4.24,4.26,4.31,4.35,4.45,4.5,4.57,4.66,4.71,4.83,4.87,4.92,4.95,5,5.12,5.27,5.42,5.93,6.05,6.12,6.19,6.27,6.36,6.46,6.53,6.61,6.63,6.72,6.84,6.92,6.98,7.02,7.06,7.12,7.2,7.26,7.31,7.41,7.52,7.59,7.64,7.67,7.71,7.78,7.84,7.88,7.93,7.96,8.01,8.05,8.09,8.16,8.22,8.28,8.34,8.41,8.46,8.58,8.65,8.67,8.75,8.85,8.92,9.03,9.07,9.14,9.22,9.37,9.61,9.73,9.79,9.85,9.94,9.98,10.02,10.07,10.09,10.12,10.18,10.22,10.3,10.36,10.41,10.5,10.62,10.74,10.89,11.33,11.43,11.48,11.54,11.59,11.63,11.69,11.73,11.79,11.87,11.9,11.98,12.07,12.19,12.26,12.33,12.39,12.44,12.48,12.5,12.55,12.63,12.7,12.76,12.82,12.88,12.97,13.18,13.5,13.68,13.77,13.82,13.87,13.92,13.96,14,14.05,14.08,14.14,14.18,14.22,14.26,14.3,14.34,14.37,14.43,14.48,14.53,14.57,14.63,14.7,14.78,14.84,14.87